    // Shanghai (29 more gyms) — fourth of the 12 "岩馆探索" (PANDA) app cities,
    // sourced from the same footage as Xi'an/Chongqing/Nanjing. Shanghai's own
    // banner confirmed 100 gyms — by far the largest single city in this
    // footage, and this batch is deliberately a first half only (the user
