    // confirmed Shanghai candidates are backlogged in docs/tasks.md.
    // A real, non-obvious data problem was found and resolved before any of
    // this could be trusted: partway through the Shanghai tab's own
    // continuous scroll (no tab-switch banner in between), cards with
    // unambiguous Beijing place names (中关村/Zhongguancun, 五棵松/Wukesong,
    // 首钢/Shougang, 成寿寺) appeared mixed in among genuinely Shanghai-named
    // cards — confirmed via web search to be real Beijing branches of real
    // chains (e.g. 岩时攀岩's confirmed Beijing branch at Dawanglu), not a
    // coincidence or a tab-switch-animation artifact. Worse, at least one
    // card that looked "safe" by its position (人人攀岩, appearing before the
    // obvious Beijing block even started) turned out to also be Beijing on
    // individual web-search confirmation — so every single candidate below
    // was individually verified by city, not inferred from scroll position.
    // huodong.com turned out to have its own genuine, multi-page Shanghai
    // climbing-venue directory (`/venue/shanghai/rock_climbing`) that both
    // confirms a candidate really is Shanghai and gives a real address in
    // one step — used as the primary source for this batch instead of the
    // per-card photo/position guessing that Xi'an/Chongqing/Nanjing needed.
    // This cross-reference also surfaced 5 of this batch's candidates as
    // exact duplicates of gyms already in this dataset from an earlier,
    // separate Dianping pass (Jinfeng Climbing 189, Dayan Yuedong, Banana
    // Climbing (West Yan'an Road), and Benchmark Climbing Gym all matched
